1
00:00:00,345 --> 00:00:02,175
Although when he's in Batman pajamas...

2
00:00:02,414 --> 00:00:05,444
(Bernadette:)...sometimes it feels like
I'm touching his inner child.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,850
(Amy:)It's probably because they were bullied.
In a world where you can't fight back...

4
00:00:12,090 --> 00:00:14,150
(Amy:)...superheroes provide
meaningful wish-fulfillment.

5
00:00:14,326 --> 00:00:17,986
Hmm. Now I feel bad for picking on
all those kids.

6
00:00:18,197 --> 00:00:21,187
Although if Danny Biffle
didn't want to eat a mouthful of dirt...

7
00:00:21,433 --> 00:00:24,093
(Penny:)...he shouldn't have shown up
to school wearing a bow tie.

8
00:00:25,504 --> 00:00:27,664
(Bernadette:)I've never even read a comic book.
You guys?

9
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:28,859
(Penny:)Mm-mm.
- No.

10
00:00:29,041 --> 00:00:31,011
(Bernadette:)It's such an important part of their lives.

11
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:34,110
(Bernadette:)- Maybe we should try reading some.
- Seriously?

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,170
(Bernadette:)The comic book store isn't far from here.

13
00:00:37,382 --> 00:00:39,972
(Penny:)That is an amazing idea.

14
00:00:40,185 --> 00:00:42,215
(Penny:)Okay, how many of these have I had?

15
00:00:48,093 --> 00:00:50,523
(Sheldon:)I think you should turn on the GPS.

16
00:00:50,729 --> 00:00:51,819
(Leonard:)It is on.

17
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,460
(Sheldon:)But the turn-by-turn voice option isn't on.

18
00:00:54,666 --> 00:00:58,026
(Sheldon:)I know I'd feel more safe
if you turn on the turn-by-turn voice option.

